<title>USA: CCC seeks 2,225 tonnes commodities for Georgia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 2,225 tonnes commodities for Georgia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp (CCC) of the U.S. Agriculture Department said it seeks 2,225 tonnes of various commodities for donation to Georgia.</p>
<p>CCC seeks 286 tonnes of rice, 652 tonnes of vegetable oil, 286 tonnes of small red beans and 1,001 tonnes all purpose flour.</p>
<p>Shipment dates for the vegetable oil were July 6-20 while all other commodities were to be shipped June 21-July 5. Offers were due on May 15.</p>
<p>Results will be released at 1600 CDT on May 19.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
